## 1️⃣ Server‑level hardening (no code change needed yet, but worth adding)

| Why it matters | What to add | Quick example |
|----------------|-------------|---------------|
| **Prevent common web‑attacks** (XSS, click‑jacking, MIME sniffing) | `helmet` – a collection of security‑related HTTP headers | ```js const helmet = require('helmet'); app.use(helmet()); ``` |
